# The build context is the repository ROOT, so this file must live at the root.
#
# Excluding node_modules is not an optimisation. The host's copy contains macOS
# native binaries — argon2 among them — and copying those into a Debian image
# produces a build that installs cleanly and then crashes at runtime, which is a
# far more confusing failure than a slow build.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github

# Real environment files never enter an image. The harness passes configuration as
# container environment variables instead, which is what the API reads anyway.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Only the harness on the host needs these.
docker-compose.e2e.yml
infra/caddy

*.log
.DS_Store
